text:
The lighting shall be active for 3 minutes when the following conditions are activated;
-Door 1 is opened.
-Ignition clamp radio is deactived.

en:
The lighting shall be active for 3 minutes when the following conditions are activated;
-Door 1 is opened.
-Ignition clamp radio is deactived.

text:
To control the buzzer above the doors, below conditions shall be fulfilled:
- Exhibition mode (Messeschaltung) is not active;
- Door power supply signal is active;

en:
To control the buzzer above the doors, below conditions shall be fulfilled:
- Exhibition mode (Messeschaltung) is not active;
- Door power supply signal is active;

text:
The system shall provide intermittent sound during warning for the passengers
- Closing & opening operations (Ton/Toff time = 500ms/500ms);
- Door error (Ton/Toff time = 200ms/200ms);
- Emergency valve is activated (Ton/Toff time = 200ms/200ms);
The system shall be provide a possibility to recognize each unusual situation via different frequency of sound.

en:
The system shall provide intermittent sound during warning for the passengers
- Closing & opening operations (Ton/Toff time = 500ms/500ms);
- Door error (Ton/Toff time = 200ms/200ms);
- Emergency valve is activated (Ton/Toff time = 200ms/200ms);
The system shall be provide a possibility to recognize each unusual situation via different frequency of sound.

text:
To enable the doors release mode, All the conditions below shall be fulfilled:
- Doors powers supply shall be activated;
- Exhibition mode (Messe schaltung) shall not be active;
- The vehicle shall be standstill;
- Confirmation of at least one of the brake is active.

en:
To enable the doors release mode, All the conditions below shall be fulfilled:
- Doors powers supply shall be activated;
- Exhibition mode (Messe schaltung) shall not be active;
- The vehicle shall be standstill;
- Confirmation of at least one of the brake is active.

text:
The system shall be activated when at least one of the conditions below is fulfilled :
- Ignition clamp radio position is turned on;
- Exterior driver door button is pressed;
- Exhibition mode is active;
- Waiting room mode is active.
- Preconditioning function is active. (For Electric Vehicles Only)
- Remote Controller button is pressed.

en:
The system shall be activated when at least one of the conditions below is fulfilled :
- Ignition clamp radio position is turned on;
- Exterior driver door button is pressed;
- Exhibition mode is active;
- Waiting room mode is active.
- Preconditioning function is active. (For Electric Vehicles Only)
- Remote Controller button is pressed.

text:
The system shall be enable the exterior door button, if all of the conditions below are fulfilled:
1-) Exhibition mode is not active;
2-) Parking brake is active;

en:
The system shall be enable the exterior door button, if all of the conditions below are fulfilled:
1-) Exhibition mode is not active;
2-) Parking brake is active;

text:
Emergency valve shall be reset (door is supplied with compressed air again, refill) when doors are not in local mode and at least one of the following conditions is fulfilled :
- Pressing the workshop button;
- Pressing the corresponding driver door manual control button;
- Starting the engine;
- Pressing the dedicated emergency valve refill button;
- Activating the doors power supply;
- Pressing Stadium button open or close side.

en:
Emergency valve shall be reset (door is supplied with compressed air again, refill) when doors are not in local mode and at least one of the following conditions is fulfilled :
- Pressing the workshop button;
- Pressing the corresponding driver door manual control button;
- Starting the engine;
- Pressing the dedicated emergency valve refill button;
- Activating the doors power supply;
- Pressing Stadium button open or close side.

text:
The system shall provide the possibility to close the corresponding doors by the driver button if all below conditions are fulfilled:
- Ignition level shall be minimum terminal radio or preconditioning function is active.
- Corresponding door is not in local mode;
- Corresponding door is in open, opening or powerless position;
- Light barrier detection is not active;
- Corresponding door is not in emergency mode.

en:
The system shall provide the possibility to close the corresponding doors by the driver button if all below conditions are fulfilled:
- Ignition level shall be minimum terminal radio or preconditioning function is active.
- Corresponding door is not in local mode;
- Corresponding door is in open, opening or powerless position;
- Light barrier detection is not active;
- Corresponding door is not in emergency mode.

text:
Driver button shall be highlighted by the system in different modes:
- 200ms on/ 200ms off blinking, if emergency valve of corresponding door is activated when local mode is not active (highest priority);
- 200ms on/ 800ms off blinking, if error signal of the corresponding door is active when local mode is not active. ( 2nd priority)
- 200ms on/ 3000ms off blinking, if the corresponding is in local mode (3rd priority);
- Constant backlight, if the corresponding door is not closed. (4th priority)

en:
Driver button shall be highlighted by the system in different modes:
- 200ms on/ 200ms off blinking, if emergency valve of corresponding door is activated when local mode is not active (highest priority);
- 200ms on/ 800ms off blinking, if error signal of the corresponding door is active when local mode is not active. ( 2nd priority)
- 200ms on/ 3000ms off blinking, if the corresponding is in local mode (3rd priority);
- Constant backlight, if the corresponding door is not closed. (4th priority)

text:
Opening the corresponding door at half-automatic mode ;
- If one of automatic door opening buttons or special stop request buttons for the passengers (including the stop request buttons) is used ;
- Before the door release activation, the doors shall be opened and holded after enabling door release activation by the driver.
- If the door release is already active, then the corresponding door shall be opened and holded.

en:
Opening the corresponding door at half-automatic mode ;
- If one of automatic door opening buttons or special stop request buttons for the passengers (including the stop request buttons) is used ;
- Before the door release activation, the doors shall be opened and holded after enabling door release activation by the driver.
- If the door release is already active, then the corresponding door shall be opened and holded.

text:
Closing the corresponding door at half-automatic mode ;
If the door has been opened by half-automatic mode, then it shall be closed by one of the option below :
- Pressing corresponding door driver button;
- Deactivation of the door release button.

en:
Closing the corresponding door at half-automatic mode ;
If the door has been opened by half-automatic mode, then it shall be closed by one of the option below :
- Pressing corresponding door driver button;
- Deactivation of the door release button.

text:
The system shall be enable stop demand if all of the conditions below are fulfilled :
1-)Waiting room is inactive;
2-)Ignition Kl15 is active;
3-)Exhibition mode is inactive;
4-)Engine simulation mode is inactive;
5-)Door errors are inactive;
6-)Doors are closed;
7-)Pause mode is inactive.

en:
The system shall be enable stop demand if all of the conditions below are fulfilled :
1-)Waiting room is inactive;
2-)Ignition Kl15 is active;
3-)Exhibition mode is inactive;
4-)Engine simulation mode is inactive;
5-)Door errors are inactive;
6-)Doors are closed;
7-)Pause mode is inactive.

text:
The system shall deactivate the stop request, if one of the conditions below is fulfilled:
1-)Activating Door release;
2-)Turning off the ignition;
3-)Activating exhibition;
4-) Local mode(only when door zone parameter is active and at least one door is open);
4-)At least one door starts to open.

en:
The system shall deactivate the stop request, if one of the conditions below is fulfilled:
1-)Activating Door release;
2-)Turning off the ignition;
3-)Activating exhibition;
4-) Local mode(only when door zone parameter is active and at least one door is open);
4-)At least one door starts to open.

