* If lift error or lift door error is active, the button LED shall blink 500 ms ON/ 500 ms OFF.

text:
Door closing in exhibition mode ;
- 1st door shall only be forced closed by the external driver button or corresponding driver button by pressing for 10 second.
- 2nd/3rd/4th doors can be closed by the corresponding driver button by pressing for 10 second.

en:
